<title>UK: BG say MMC proposals will cut Transco revenue.</title>
<headline>BG say MMC proposals will cut Transco revenue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BG Plc said on Wednesday the Monopolies and Mergers Commission's (MMC) price review proposals will reduce revenue at TransCo, its gas transport unit, by five percent in 1997/98.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the MMC report is a &quot;tough settlement, but provided we continue to improve our efficiency, one which we believe will enable us to manage and finance our business effectively.&quot;</p>
</text>
